          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The
            %em disjoint union
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproduct"} coproduct
            in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sets"} sets
          %p
            In a general
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproducts"} coproducts
            need not have the expected disjointness property of those in
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/disjoint+coproducts"} disjoint coproducts
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            Given any family
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
